// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Antonio Nash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P943755051" "Antonio Nash"
// ProfessionString :
"P1213005310" "Mutation Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P3533566513" "Antonio Nash has the ability to instantly solve any mathematical equation.  He worked for the Department of Defense for years, but, when the danger to his home town of Paragon City continued to rise, he asked to be reassigned to GIFT, a section of the Federal Bureau of Super-powered Affairs.  Now, as a member of the Genetic Investigation and Facilitation Team, he is the primary contact point for many new mutant Heroes.  Having grown up on the streets of Paragon City as a member of the Outcasts gang, Antonio makes a point of keeping himself informed on current gang activity."
// HelloString :
"P853460135" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We must reclaim this city, {HeroName}.  Will you help me?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3461423729" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I need your assistance.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P753996787" "I can't help you, but maybe another contact can."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1307612775" "Greetings, {HeroName}, I have been briefed about your abilities as a {HeroClass}.  We have much to do.  Let us begin."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2046795827" "Sorry, I don't have any more missions for you.  You should ask your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P570402265" "You need to finish some of the things you already have on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2827970448" "I have a task I'd like you to handle, but we'll have to wait until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3389777" "You have already done much to help Paragon City.  I am grateful to you, my friend.  Let me help you <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>gear up</a> for the dangers ahead.  Whenever you need me, just call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2849001497" "{HeroName}, I am very pleased with the work you are doing.  I'd like to help <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>outfit you</a> for your next mission."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P887637760" "The time has come for you to carry on the fight without me, {HeroName}!"
// LocationString :
"P409428935" "Atlas Park, City Hall"
// IntroString :
"P691296237" "This should not appear for this contact."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1178083046" "I would very much like you to introduce you to a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>good friend</A> of mine who may, in turn, be able to help you upon your road to herodom."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


