// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : City Representative 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2401378727" "City Representative"
// ProfessionString :
"P1921171616" "City Representative"
// LocationString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3660652180" "Before the Rikti Invasion, the City Representative's tasks were largely ceremonial.  Now, with many new threats on the horizon, she's charged with coordinating the efforts of the various branches of the FBSA.  According to well-known mystic, Azuria, the City Rep has risen to her new challenges admirably.  It's often said that there is no one who knows more about the inner workings of the city than she."
// HelloString :
"P2422200464" "There is a task I'd like you to take on."
// HelloString :
"P3833473869" "The city thanks you for your assistance."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3449297959" "I must insist that you introduce yourself through the proper channels.  Perhaps you should talk to one of your other contacts."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1856471963" "It's Heroes like you who keep this building standing."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1671954291" "There is nothing you can do for me, my friend.  But I am sure your other contacts would appreciate your assistance."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1339059066" "I am sorry, but I have a strict policy against overloading Heroes.  You already have enough to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2135666838" "My next task is only for those Heroes who have attained Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3881545577" "You have done well, {HeroName}.  It is no wonder this city looks up to you.  You can call me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4205886468" "The city needs you, {HeroName}, but you can do nothing more for me."
// IntroString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


