// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jonathan St. John Smythe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3197681515" "Jonathan St. John Smythe"
// ProfessionString :
"P312397254" "Science Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P298006279" "Professor Jonathan St. John-Smythe is a brilliant research scientist whose inventions have been of great help to Paragon City and its Heroes.  The Professor works for SERAPH, which is a section of the Federal Bureau of Super-powered Affairs.  SERAPH stands for Scientific Experimentation, Research, and Application to Paranormal Humans.  His primary duty is monitoring and measuring the power levels of the city's Heroes, and he is always eager to help new Heroes better understand their powers.  He is fascinated by the Vahzilok, and he gathers information on their activities whenever possible."
// HelloString :
"P740908335" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready for a new mission, I trust?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4276296140" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Oh, hello. Up for a spot of action?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P345313734" "I'm terribly sorry, but you should be talking to someone else instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2317243257" "Oh, hello.  Here to do some good for the city, are you?  I have your file here somewhere. {HeroName}, isn't it? With {HeroOrigin} based {HeroClass} powers, I do believe.  Excellent.  Let's begin."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4258255195" "I don't have anything more for you.  Perhaps your other contacts have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3972840816" "My goodness, haven't you got enough to do already?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1042310115" "I have something, but it's classified Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2627861566" "You are beginning to master your powers, {HeroName}.  Jolly well done, my friend.  I believe I can offer you <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>greater assistance</a> now."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1584262353" "I do believe I can trust you fully at this point, {HeroName}.  Come, let's find you <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>some new trinkets</a> in my lab.  I am at your disposal."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P921649870" "I believe the time has come for you to forge ahead without me."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2794931176" "It would be my pleasure to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>introduce you to someone</A> who could be very helpful to your future."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


