// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Rick Davies 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2839176367" "Rick Davies"
// ProfessionString :
"P27852938" "Technology Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P2240086911" "Rick was one of the first Heroes in Paragon City to use powered armor.  He fought the Rikti under the code name Horatio, but the injuries he received ended his career as a Hero.  Never one to rest on his laurels, Rick began working with DATA, the Department of Advanced Technological Application.  DATA is a section of the Federal Bureau of Super-powered Affairs.  Rick threw himself into helping new Heroes with their struggles against Paragon City's many criminals.  His sister, Susan, is also a Hero liaison.  Rick loves tinkering; therefore, the Clockwork are of utmost interest to him.  Rick recently wed his long-time girlfriend Caitlin Murray in a small private ceremony."
// HelloString :
"P67668458" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to fight the good fight?  There's work to be done.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3665699787" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I think I can steer you in the direction of some trouble.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1546632384" "Try talking to one of your other contacts instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P553801629" "This city needs {HeroOrigin} Heroes more than ever.  You look like you're up to it, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P278052850" "There's no more work for you here.  Try your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P133330815" "I appreciate your enthusiasm, but you can only do so much.  You should complete some of your other tasks."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1097074818" "Check back when you reach Security Level {Level}.  I may have something for you then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4047517257" "You show a lot of promise, my friend.  I wish Paragon City had more Heroes like you.  Please let me know how I can <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>assist you.</a> Call on me at any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4018422551" "You are doing an excellent job, {HeroName}.  I think I can trust you with some more difficult assignments.  You'll need to be <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>well-prepared.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2957225761" "Your days as a novice Hero are over.  Good luck!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4165002410" "I think it's time you met another <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> of mine."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


