// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Susan Davies 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P196097607" "Susan Davies"
// ProfessionString :
"P1110709240" "Natural Hero Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P3709652430" "On the surface, Susan Davies is a quiet, unassuming government liaison working in the ELITE section of the Federal Bureau of Super-powered Affairs.  ELITE stands for Enhanced Logistics for Insight and Tactical Excellence.  Some say that Susan has much more power than she lets on.  One thing is certain: she has no shortage of well-placed contacts.  Her brother, Rick, once the Hero known as Horatio, is now the liaison for new technology Heroes.  Susan knows about everything going on in Paragon City, and she keeps an especially close watch on gang activities.  She shares her knowledge with new Heroes, but she believes that no amount of advice can substitute for training and determination."
// HelloString :
"P3629203699" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Are you ready for some action?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1531226626" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have a new assignment for you.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1934190760" "I don't deal with {HeroOrigin} Heroes."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1157376118" "I have nothing to say to you.  Why not try {LastContactName}?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P3942514568" "Do your job and we'll get along fine, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P816183926" "I don't have any more tasks that would interest you.  Check with your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3017582105" "You're far too busy to take on another task, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P293095225" "I have something, but it's very hush-hush.  Try me when you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1983599249" "You're doing well, my friend.  Don't let up.  Remember, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>preparation</a> is the key to success.  And don't hesitate to call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P496551569" "You've actually managed to impress me, {HeroName}.  I am happy to do anything within my power to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>assist you.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3696138252" "We're done, {HeroName}.  You're on your own now."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1573419352" "I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>new contact</A> for you to meet.  I think you can help each other out."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


